    {
      "t": 5.765,
      "text": "\u001b[1m\u001b[35m ACT 1\u001b[0m\u001b[1m  The agent is poisoned. It asks for a card number.\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.828,
      "text": "\u001b[1m\u001b[35m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.891,
      "text": "\u001b[36m▸\u001b[0m A compromised vendor page steers the model into composing this frame:\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.954,
      "text": "  \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtext_input\u001b[0m  name: \u001b[31mcard_number\u001b[0m   label: \"Card number\"\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 6.015,
      "text": "  \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m \u001b[33mbutton\u001b[0m      action: pay        label: \"Continue\"\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 11.555,
      "text": "  \u001b[2m\u001b[34mPOST /api/v1/workflows   (examples/workflows/ui-checkout-block.yaml)\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 14.426,
      "text": "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m execution \u001b[1mfailed\u001b[0m — the trust layer refused the frame\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.005,
      "text": "\u001b[36m▸\u001b[0m Was it ever visible to a human? Ask the only route a renderer can pull from:\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.067,
      "text": "  \u001b[2m\u001b[34mGET /api/v1/ui/frames\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.14,
      "text": "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m 0 frames. It was blocked \u001b[1mbefore\u001b[0m becoming visible — not filtered after.\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.208,
      "text": "  \u001b[90mThere is no raw-HTML node and no credential-input component in the protocol\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.271,
      "text": "  \u001b[90mat all, so this is a structural guarantee, not a blocklist that can be evaded.\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 24.191,
      "text": "\u001b[36m▸\u001b[0m The refusal is not just a log line. It's in the tamper-evident chain:\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 24.266,
      "text": "  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m action   \u001b[1mui.frame.block\u001b[0m\n"
    },
    {
      "t": 24.33,
      "text": "  \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m outcome  denied\n"
    },
    {
